sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Home as Home page (useAuth)
    participant API as GraphQL API
    participant Val as ValidationPipe
    participant Svc as UserService
    participant DB as SQLite

    User->>Home: submit e-mail
    Home->>API: mutation createOrLoginUser(email)

    rect rgb(235, 245, 235)
        note over API,DB: Happy path — valid, existing or new e-mail
        API->>Val: validate UserInput (@IsEmail, @IsNotEmpty)
        Val-->>API: valid
        API->>Svc: createOrLogin(email)
        Svc->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
        alt user exists
            DB-->>Svc: user row
        else user does not exist
            DB-->>Svc: none
            Svc->>DB: INSERT INTO users
            DB-->>Svc: new user row
        end
        Svc-->>API: User
        API-->>Home: { id, email }
        Home->>User: navigate to /dashboard?id=...
    end

    rect rgb(250, 235, 235)
        note over API,Val: Sad path — malformed e-mail
        Home->>API: mutation createOrLoginUser("not-an-email")
        API->>Val: validate UserInput
        Val-->>API: BAD_USER_INPUT (Invalid email format)
        API-->>Home: GraphQLError
        Home->>User: alert(error.message)
    end
